WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Your story. Every screen.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Bring your story in. Footage first. Your destinations next.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Make the cut yours. Compare. Reframe. Split the real timeline.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Give it a release date. From the publishing queue to your calendar.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Find your next move. Explore performance. Change the perspective.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Make your next release. Start creating.
